save(331,dict(paragraphs=["Soumya Sephali Sahoo writes poetry in English and combines literary work with teaching. Rama Devi Women’s University’s English department report for 2019–20 records her supervision of undergraduate projects on subjects including women’s writing, Odisha’s folktales and myth. Engrace Foundation’s profile connects this academic background with her contributions to poetry and story anthologies, including ‘Unbottomed Purple Nous’ and ‘Resplendent Rainbow’.","Her two Kabita Live poems use familiar objects and performances to test larger wishes. In ‘Abracadabra’, a stage magician’s tricks become the starting point for imagining weapons turned into books and reconciliation in divided communities. ‘Paperboat’ works in the opposite direction: a long catalogue of Martha’s ambitions gives way to the fragile craft named in its title."],sources=[source('Rama Devi Women’s University: English annual report 2019–20','https://rdwu.ac.in/pdf/DEPT_DOCS/English/Annual_Report_2019-2020.pdf','Pages4–5, PDF page index4: Soumya Sephali Sahoo listed as undergraduate dissertation supervisor; themes of assigned projects, historical role only.'),source('Engrace Foundation: team biography','https://engracefoundation.org/team.php','English academic background, Bhubaneswar and matching bibliography of anthology contributions.','search_index_direct_open_failed')],identity_match='Full distinctive name and English/Bhubaneswar context in institutional report, joined through foundation biography with exact anthology titles matching captured biography.',poems_read=[dict(id=407,title='ABRACADABRA',coverage='Full original, six stanzas.',basis='Stage magic develops into wishes for peace, transformed weapons, reconciliation and opposition to racism.'),dict(id=440,title='PAPERBOAT',coverage='Full original, two stanzas.',basis='Martha’s long catalogue of material/educational ambitions turns on the luxury-cruise/paperboat contrast.')],limitations=['No publisher/catalogue record found for debut wording Elfin Verses and Nifty Proverbs; foundation punctuation may represent one title or two. No shelf entry or new definitive title assertion added.','No independent organiser source for 21st Century Emily Dickinson Award located; preserved captured claim not repeated in new prose.','No current university appointment asserted from2019–20 report. Foundation is an associated organisation, not independent certification of every biography claim.','No gold-medal granting institution, 500-quote count or total-publication count independently verified.'],search_queries=['"Soumya Sephali Sahoo" author','"Elfin Verses" "Nifty"','"Soumya Sephali" publisher','"Elfin Verses and Nifty Proverbs"','"Elfin Verses" Sahoo book','"Nifty Proverbs" book'],next_action='Independent author/editor factual review; clarify debut title and provide publisher/award evidence.'))
